{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は13日の金曜日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かーがおこーりそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はある撮影をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強になることばっかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は伊藤ちゃんずのちっさい方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれた日ですー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね18歳おめでとうーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中身は本当に大人だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりも落ち着いてるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、かわいいです愛おしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにこのポーズかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようちぇけ！って感じがかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣な話もくだらない話も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな話聞いてくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やさしいねねがだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき初めてコンビニのおでん食べた！餅巾着の中にお肉が入ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はんぺんも大根も美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また食べよーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/13/3257410/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}